1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,500
Do'koningdan har kuni pul oqib ketyapti.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,800
Sen esa buni ko'rmaysan.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,800
Qanaqa pul? Men seni faqat rasm va video uchun ishlataman.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,900
Rasm yaxshi. Lekin meni rasm uchun o'ylab topishmagan.

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:27,400
1956-yili olimlar so'rashdi: mashina odamning aqliy ishini qila oladimi?

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:32,900
Sen kun bo'yi kassaga, telefonga, mijozga qaraysan.

7
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,500
Oshpaz stoliga esa hech kim qaramaydi.

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,900
Bitta lavash sousiz ketdi.

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,900
Mijoz indamadi.

10
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,200
Lekin qaytib kelmadi.

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,700
Nazoratchi yollaymanmi? Unga oylik kerak.

12
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,900
Bitta kichik kamera. U faqat stolni ko'radi.

13
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,700
Go'sht, sabzavot, sous.

14
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,500
To'xtang.

15
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,000
Sous hali qo'shilmadi.

16
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,200
Faqat lavash uchunmi?

17
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,700
Yo'q.

18
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:07,500
Eng qimmat ish qo'l bilan emas, bosh bilan qilinadi.

19
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,000
Shifokor, yurist.

20
00:01:11,550 --> 00:01:15,700
Bitta yaxshi shifokorni tayyorlash qancha turadi?

21
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,900
Avval tug'ilishi kerak.

22
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:19,500
Keyin maktab.

23
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,200
Keyin institut.

24
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:25,700
Keyin yillar davomida amaliyot.

25
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:31,750
Sen esa uning oldiga yigirma daqiqaga kirasan.

26
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:36,550
Va o'sha yillarning hammasi uchun to'laysan.

27
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:39,000
AI-shifokor arzonroqmi?

28
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:43,100
Men tahlilingni oddiy tilda tushuntiraman.

29
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:46,650
Shifokorga qanday savol berishni aytaman.

30
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:49,450
Kechasi soat uchda ham.

31
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,450
Yurist-chi?

32
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:52,100
Shartnoma qoralamasi.

33
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:54,750
Qiyin so'zlarni tushuntirish.

34
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:58,300
Ijara shartnomasida yashirin jarimani topish.

35
00:01:58,450 --> 00:02:00,050
Bir necha daqiqada.

36
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:02,250
Unda shifokor bilan yurist kerak emasmi?

37
00:02:02,450 --> 00:02:03,300
Kerak.

38
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:06,600
Mening javoblarimni kimdir tekshirishi kerak.

39
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:09,850
Ayniqsa ish murakkab bo'lsa.

40
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,600
Yoki xato juda qimmat bo'lsa.

41
00:02:13,850 --> 00:02:16,900
Kamera, tahlillar, shartnomalar...

42
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,350
Telefonimga, pullarimga kirib olmaysanmi?

43
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:23,650
Men parol so'ramayman.

44
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:25,550
Parolingni so'ragan «AI»dan qoch.

45
00:02:25,850 --> 00:02:26,550
U AI emas, firibgar.

46
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,550
Unda oshpazni bo'shatamanmi?

47
00:02:29,050 --> 00:02:29,800
Yo'q.

48
00:02:30,050 --> 00:02:33,300
Men lavash o'ray olmayman. Oshpaz qo'l, men ko'z.

49
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:35,100
Sizda ham do'kon bormi?

